.DS_Store
.claude/
__pycache__/
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# data/<city>/flagged_buildings.geojson IS tracked. It is a per-run Earth
# Engine export and was ignored on that reasoning, but the hosted demo is a
# directory of static files with no build step: a layer that is not in the
# repository is a layer the deployed site does not have. 1.6 MB is a fair
# price for the ranked list, the per-building panel and the CSV working for
# anyone who opens the link.

# Local secrets (GROQ_API_KEY etc.) and editor folders. render.yaml keeps the
# key in the Render dashboard; a local .env must never be committed either.
.env
.env.*
*.pyc
.vscode/
.idea/
